ve video game that tells an original story in a choice-driven adventure set within the iconic sci-fi universe", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/star-trek-resurgence", "videos": [{"id": 61862, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "vewx3kN_jwk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vewx3kN_jwk", "title": "Star Trek Resurgence  - Official Reveal Trailer | Game Awards 2021", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vewx3kN_jwk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 151368, "name": "Accolades Trailer", "video_id": "_SaGlhUXHNc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_SaGlhUXHNc", "title": "Star Trek: Resurgence // Accolade Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_SaGlhUXHNc/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}